  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Five Xiangs grotto-heaven, Fang Yuan activates the immortal killer move Myriad Thought Sword Waterfall inside heaven form. It slams into the wills stored at the bottom; each drop is a thought with the appearance of a sword. The crash opens a huge crevice and destroys a large amount of wills, then leaves a lake of sword thoughts.",
      "chapters": [
        1821
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_five_xiangs_grotto_heaven",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Facing Duke Long, Fang Yuan turns his head and spits out a waterfall as Myriad Thought Sword Waterfall. The sword waterfall crashes down with huge momentum, every drop a sword thought, and he follows with swordsman so sword thoughts form warriors in his appearance that charge forward. Duke Long retreats on sight of the move, and Fang Yuan uses the opening to break free and charge toward Heaven Overseeing Tower.",
      "chapters": [
        1945
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_long",
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Duke Long lists myriad thought sword waterfall among Fang Yuan’s sword path combat system methods.",
      "chapters": [
        1946
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "combat-system",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After resolving a myriad tribulation, Fang Yuan tests the move again: a silver waterfall of sword-shaped thoughts flattens a hill in a few breaths and leaves a shallow pool of flowing sword thoughts. He treats it as a compound killer move formed from wisdom path and sword path, not a single-path move with other paths only as support. With heaven path dao marks cutting internal friction in compound killer moves, its power rises by several times and it activates more smoothly.",
      "chapters": [
        2065
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "compound-move-power",
